window.AKK_FREELOADING_DAILY_BUT_THE_SYSTEM_MAKES_ME_A_BIG_SPENDER_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_FREELOADING_DAILY_BUT_THE_SYSTEM_MAKES_ME_A_BIG_SPENDER_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1: It's Just a Flop, So Why Is the Whole Internet Begging to Be My Apprentice","paragraphs":["Content warnings:","Brain-checking station (✿╹◡╹)","1. The online and real-life portions are portrayed in a 1:1 ratio.","2. The amounts of money get pretty outrageous later on.","3. All the male leads are completely clean.","4. Every platform has different burner accounts, and there are lots of aliases.","5. Every type of livestreaming will make an appearance, though voice-chat rooms will get the most attention.","6. The heroine has multiple men on the go at once. Now that she has a tycoon system, sticking to a one-on-one relationship would be a waste of such a cheat.","The light from the phone screen flickered across Gu Lan’s face.","Her private messages and comment section on Douyin had been completely overrun.","Half the comments came from indignant self-appointed justice warriors, condemning her for playing with people’s feelings and calling her nothing short of a shameless heartbreaker.","The other half... had taken a rather strange turn.","[Girl, I don’t care how you managed to date two guys at once. I just want to know how you got two streamers completely obsessed with you without spending a single cent.]","[I spent over eighty thousand yuan on my favorite streamer and couldn’t even get a private-message friend slot. Can you teach me how to freeload like you? I’ll pay!]","[Please, I want a tutorial too! I feel like I’ve been watching livestreams wrong all this time—and wasting my money. So this is what high-level gameplay looks like?]","[I spent hundreds of thousands and didn’t even get to hold his hand! What does that make me?]","[It makes you rich.]","Expressionless, Gu Lan scrolled through the screen. Her fingertip lightly tapped the comments asking for a tutorial before she quickly swiped past them.","Both streamers had blocked her.","One was a singer, the other a dancer.","One had a gorgeous face, the other an incredible voice.","She had spent an entire summer painstakingly winning them over, wheedling and coaxing until she finally got them interested. Then, because of an unexpected cross-room PK battle, all her hard work had gone up in smoke.","How heartbreaking.","Gu Lan pursed her lips. The unhappiness in her heart was less heartbreak than the fury of having a carefully cultivated game save suddenly deleted.","As for the people cursing her, she filtered them out automatically. The ones begging for a tutorial, however, gave her a strange sense of smug satisfaction.","They wanted to learn?","This wasn’t something anyone could master just by studying. Talent was required.","She couldn’t stay on this platform anymore—or at least not for a while.","Gu Lan sighed and dug through a pile of flashy game apps until she found a plain-looking one: Oxygen Voice.","She had downloaded it ages ago but never used it once.","She might as well use this little no-name platform as a temporary refuge.","Once the app finished downloading and updating, she began registering a new account with practiced ease.","Username: Food Liu You.","Profile picture: an abstract, crookedly drawn picture of Lazy Goat that looked both depressed and obnoxious.","Done.","The moment she tapped “Complete,” an electronic voice that clearly did not come from her phone’s speakers exploded inside her head.","[Ding—]","[Host detected exhibiting stingy heartbreaker behavior. Qualification for binding confirmed.]","Gu Lan’s hand froze around her phone.","Was she hallucinating? Had staying up too late finally fried her brain?","[Online Tycoon System 3.0—Simp Edition—activating...]","[Activation successful!]","The voice rang out again, crystal clear this time, with a barely suppressed excitement, like a chatterbox who had finally found someone to unload on.","[Hello, Host! I’m your personal System 3.0. You can call me San-chan! In light of your previous “only take, never give” behavior, this system will help you turn over a new leaf and become the most popular big-spending queen on the internet!]","Gu Lan: “...”","What the hell?","“Only take, never give”?","Was this thing calling her stingy?","Before she could even finish complaining internally, the chatty system spilled out all the rules like beans from a broken pod.","[The rules are very simple! Whenever you spend money online on a male with a score of eighty or above in looks, you’ll receive a one-to-one cash rebate!]","[Spend money on an absolutely gorgeous man with a looks score of ninety or above, and you’ll receive a one-to-ten cash rebate!]","[The looks score will be automatically determined by the system’s backend. Fair and impartial! Host, forget the penny-pinching version of yourself and embark on your path to becoming a tycoon!]","Spend money?","On men?","Gu Lan’s first reaction was resistance. What kind of joke was this? Her motto in life was, “Freeloading is king.”","Asking her to spend money was practically the same as asking her to die.","But...","A one-to-ten rebate?","That number circled through her mind, and its meaning instantly changed.","If she sent a super-handsome guy ten thousand yuan in gifts, the system would give her one hundred thousand in return? She’d make a net profit of ninety thousand?","This... wasn’t spending money at all. It was making money!","And it was the ultimate way to get rich by turning nothing into something!","Gu Lan’s thoughts began to race.","She could use someone else’s money to pursue the handsome men she wanted, and in the end, the money would still end up in her own pocket.","Was there anything more wonderful in the world?","“Not bad,” she murmured, tentatively acknowledging the pie that had fallen from the sky.","[Host, would you like to accept the binding? Countdown: ten, nine...]","“Accept.” Gu Lan didn’t hesitate.","Anyone who refused free money was an idiot.","[Binding successful! Best wishes on your spending spree, Host. May you become a wealthy woman soon!]","The system’s voice cheerfully faded away.","Gu Lan turned her attention back to the phone screen.","The Oxygen Voice app’s homepage was extremely simple. Row after row of rooms filled the screen, divided into all sorts of categories.","[Songs on Request], [Voice Acting], [Emotional Radio], [Voice Chat & Dating].","It was an entirely different world from the Douyin she had used before.","Most of the streamers here never showed their faces. Their cover images were either anime-style handsome men, scenic views, or abstract avatars like hers.","How was she supposed to find men with looks scores of eighty or ninety?","Was this system deliberately making things difficult for her?","There was no way she could throw money at an anime avatar without knowing who was behind it. What if the person on the other side turned out to be a hairy middle-aged man? Who would she even complain to then?","Irritably scratching at her hair, Gu Lan decided to start with the most popular room.","She entered a room tagged [Goodnight Melodies], where the number of viewers was displayed as 99+.","The moment she entered, a noisy wave of excitement slammed into her.","A young man was belting out a popular love song over the public mic. Not only was he singing wildly off-key—somewhere around Siberia—he also seemed completely convinced that he sounded amazing. Every note dragged on forever.","A crowd of young girls flooded the public chat with messages like “You’re amazing, big brother!” and “Your singing is so beautiful!” The free flower gifts flashed across the screen almost nonstop.","Gu Lan’s ears suffered severe occupational damage.","This was the platform’s most popular room?","Her opinion of the platform’s average quality plummeted instantly.","With a voice like that, he would have been hunted down by the entire voice-lover community she belonged to.","Just as she was preparing to pinch her nose and leave the room, a clear yet slightly lazy male voice came through the public mic.","The voice wasn’t particularly loud or soft, but it seemed to carry a magnetic hook. It pierced through the surrounding noise and slipped precisely into her ears.","“All right, thank you to Mic One for that deeply heartfelt performance. It was very... spirited.”","He paused, as though carefully choosing his words. In the end, he settled on “spirited,” a trace of laughter concealed in the lingering note of his voice.","“Next up—friend on mic two, are you there?”","Gu Lan’s finger, poised to click the exit button, froze in midair.","Her entire body went still.","That voice...","It was incredible.","It was practically tailor-made to hit every one of her voice-crush sweet spots.","The TikTok disaster, the infuriating comments, and that money-draining system—all of it was instantly banished to the farthest reaches of her mind.","There was only one thought left in her head.","He had to be mine."]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2: The plot of looking down on level 0 low-level accounts, though late, still arrives","paragraphs":["Gu Lan stood frozen in place as though someone had cast a petrification spell on her. Even her breathing instinctively grew lighter.","That clear, mellow male voice didn’t speak again. Another person took over the public mic and began singing another sugary little love song of unknown origin.","But Gu Lan’s ears had already blocked out every other sound automatically.","Her mind kept replaying that one sentence from moments ago:","“Very... spirited.”","The slight pause, the lazy smile hidden in the lilt of his voice—every tiny detail landed precisely on all her weak spots, teasing an itch in her heart.","She silently lingered in the room like a leopard hiding in the grass, patiently waiting for its prey.","She wasn’t in a hurry.","The more exceptional the prey, the more patience it required.","Minute after minute passed. The songs on the public mic changed one after another, and Gu Lan’s patience was nearly worn away by all the screeching and howling.","Just as she was about to visit another room, a private-message notification popped up at the top of her phone.","It was a message from the Oxygen app.","She opened it and saw that it had been sent by someone with the ID “Wn.Qing.”","[Wn.Qing: Sis, would you like to hear a song? I can sing pop songs, and I’m not too bad.]","Gu Lan raised an eyebrow.","That opening line... was far too plain.","It sounded exactly like something a rookie would say—he didn’t even know how to come up with a decent sales pitch. Back when she used Douyin, streamers went all-out trying to attract attention. Their copywriting had become so elaborate it was practically an art form.","“A newcomer?” she wondered.","Still, someone taking the initiative was better than no one at all.","Gu Lan’s thoughts shifted, and she called for the system in her head.","“San-chan, get out here and do some work. Check the looks of this ‘Wn.Qing’ and that host from earlier, ‘Wn.Xu.’”","[Ding! Appearance assessment in progress...]","[Wn.Qing, appearance score: 81. The host may receive a 1:1 rebate on the user’s spending.]","[Wn.Xu, appearance score: 90. The host may receive a 1:10 rebate on the user’s spending.]","Ninety points! A tenfold rebate!","Gu Lan’s heart gave a sharp thump.","Her ears hadn’t deceived her after all! Someone with a voice this incredible absolutely had to be good-looking too!","As for Qing... 81 points was barely passing, and his rebate was only one-to-one.","Even a tiny mosquito was still meat.","Besides, Qing was the only one who had taken the initiative to contact her.","In the past, she hadn’t had any money and could only sit in the audience, watching other people lavish fortunes on handsome men.","But now...","Gu Lan’s thoughts went around in countless twists and turns, and a mischievous smile slowly curled across her lips.","Times had changed. Now that she had money, it was finally the handsome men’s turn to fawn over her.","She leisurely typed a reply to Qing.","[Food Liu You: This is my first time using this, so I don’t really understand (。•『•。).]","Playing dumb was a woman’s innate talent.","After sending the message, she asked the system again, “San-chan, I can’t actually be spending my own money, can I?”","The system’s cheerful voice immediately rang out:","[The unlimited black card has been credited! The card number has been automatically saved to your mobile wallet. Please bind it and recharge as needed!]","Gu Lan immediately exited the app. Sure enough, she found a black card she had never seen before in her mobile wallet. There was no bank logo on it—only a string of numbers shimmering with rainbow-colored light.","She skillfully copied the card number, returned to the Oxygen app’s recharge page, selected the highest amount, pasted in the number, and entered the password.","[Recharge successful! Your account has received 1,000,000 diamonds. (Exchange rate: 1 diamond = 0.01 yuan.)]","Ten thousand yuan in exchange for one million diamonds.","Looking at that long string of zeroes, Gu Lan nodded in satisfaction.","She’d test the waters first.","When she returned to the “Goodnight Melody” room, a round of mic rotations had just ended.","That clear, mellow male voice she couldn’t stop thinking about rang out once more.","“All right, the mic rotation is over. Sisters lurking in the background, does anyone else want to request a song?”","It was him! It was Xu!","Gu Lan’s heartbeat skipped, and she hurriedly typed in the public chat.","[Food Liu You: How do I request a song? (confused).jpg]","Xu’s voice carried a smile as he was about to explain. “To request a song, just find the—”","Before he could finish, a dazzling gift animation suddenly exploded across the screen.","A gigantic pink “Love Confession Balloon” slowly rose into view, taking up half the screen.","[Strawberry Cheesecake sent Wn.Muzhi a Love Confession Balloon x1 (52,000 diamonds = 520 yuan)]","Immediately afterward, another somewhat urgent male voice forced its way in, cutting Xu off.","“Thanks for the Love Confession Balloon, Sis Cheesecake! Mwah! You’re spoiling me, Sis! Sorry, Brother Xu, I’m going to sing a song for my sis first.”","It was the one called Muzhi.","Gu Lan stared at the public chat. After being interrupted, Xu didn’t say anything else, and the entire public mic was soon taken over by Muzhi and Strawberry Cheesecake’s interaction.","Gu Lan pouted.","So this was what cutting in line looked like.","A wealthy older sister really was something else.","She wasn’t angry, though. Instead, she cheerfully continued typing in the public chat.","[Food Liu You: Wow, so lucky! I get to listen for free.]","She put on an innocent, clueless act.","Just then, another private message lit up.","It was from Xu.","[Wn.Xu: Find the “Request a Song” gift worth 3,320 diamonds in the gift list, choose the host you want to request it from, and send it. That’s all.]","He had even attached a screenshot of the gift list, with the “Request a Song” gift clearly circled.","Oh, he was pretty considerate.","Gu Lan’s impression of Xu improved a little more.","[Food Liu You: Got it! Thank you!]","[Food Liu You: (Thank you).jpg]","She returned to the room. Muzhi had already started singing.","Gu ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌‍Lan patiently listened for two lines.","How should she put it? He had some technical skill, but his singing felt greasy. Every vocal flourish carried the deliberate air of someone saying, “Hurry up and praise how handsome I am.”","Compared with Xu’s clear, natural voice, it was practically a public execution.","Gu Lan, who was used to hearing divine-level singers on Douyin, really couldn’t bear to listen any longer.","She exited the room without hesitation.","She’d come back after this Muzhi finished singing.","She had no interest in wasting her time on singing of this caliber.","At the same time Gu Lan left the room, a new message appeared in a WeChat group called “Goodnight Melody Lineup.”","[Wn.Xu: @Wn.Muzhi, next time, wait until I’ve finished explaining how to request a song before interrupting.]","The group fell silent for a few seconds.","Then someone named Wn.Yechen jumped in.","[Wn.Yechen: Oh, come on, Brother Xu, don’t be mad. Brother Muzhi was only thinking about the room’s revenue. Look, Sis Cheesecake even sent gifts.]","Yechen sent another message.","[Wn.Yechen: That Food Liu You person is a level-zero account. Who knows whether she’ll actually spend anything? It’s more important to take care of big spenders like Sis Cheesecake.]","[Wn.Muzhi: Sis Cheesecake never cut in line when she used to watch Brother Xu. I spoiled her too much. Sorry.]","[Wn.Ears: Oho, showing off now, are we?]"]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3: I heard you can cut in line if you have money Then let me casually cut in line","paragraphs":["Gu Lan was idly browsing the Oxygen app.","She clicked into several of the most popular voice rooms and listened to a few so-called “heavenly voices,” only to be sorely disappointed.","Some had such heavy voice effects that they sounded obviously fake. Others were oily and affected, twisting every word into eighteen different flourishes.","Not one of them could compare to Xu.","That man’s voice was like mint soda chilled in the height of summer—crisp, clean, with a faint, barely perceptible laziness in its bubbles.","Just listening to him was soothing.","After wandering around for a while, Gu Lan failed to find any suitable substitute and could only slink back to the “Goodnight Melody” room.","The moment she entered, she heard a commotion on the microphones.","Muzhi had already finished singing and was chatting animatedly with the woman nicknamed Strawberry Cheesecake.","“Cheesecake Sis, the avatar frame and chat bubble you’re using today are so pretty!”","“Of course they are. My Cheesecake Sis looks good in everything!” a man’s ingratiating voice immediately chimed in. It belonged to Yechen.","Gu Lan listened for a moment, feeling rather bored.","She wanted to hear Xu speak.","But aside from those two, all the other hosts connected to the microphones were sitting in complete silence, as if they had turned invisible.","Just as she was about to leave the room running while she scrolled through short videos, two messages suddenly appeared on the public chat.","[Wn.Xu: @Food Liu You, welcome back.]","[Wn.Qing: @Food Liu You, welcome back, Sis.]","Gu Lan froze.","They... remembered her?","She was only a level-zero alt account, and she had just left the room without saying a word.","She looked at the two names on the public chat. One was refined and clear, the other youthful and fresh. For some reason, she found them exceptionally pleasing to the eye.","Then she glanced at Muzhi, who was still chattering away and fawning over the older woman on the microphone. A mischievous idea suddenly popped into Gu Lan’s head.","She leisurely opened her gift inventory.","The diamonds she had just purchased were still gleaming.","She found the “Confession Balloon,” a gift worth 52,000 diamonds.","Then, without hurry, she selected two recipients at once: Wn.Xu and Wn.Qing.","Confirm. Send.","The next second—","“...and I’m telling you, Cheesecake Sis, she...”","Muzhi’s voice cut off abruptly on the microphone.","It was as though someone had strangled him.","The entire screen was swallowed by two enormous special effects exploding one after another.","Magnificent pink balloons carrying hearts slowly rose into the air. The animation was exquisite yet domineering, taking up everyone’s field of vision.","[Food Liu You sent Wn.Xu a Confession Balloon x1 (52,000 diamonds)]","[Food Liu You sent Wn.Qing a Confession Balloon x1 (52,000 diamonds)]","The public chat fell into deathly silence for a moment before exploding.","[Wn.Ears: !!! Holy crap! Thank you, my Food Liu You Sis, for sending Confession Balloons to Brother Xu and Qing! What a generous boss! May you make a fortune!]","[Wn.Volcano: Thank you, Sis, for supporting Xu and Qing! Sis, you’re incredible!]","[Wn.Yechen: Thank you, Sis...]","The hosts connected to the microphones seemed to have been switched on by some invisible button. One after another, they began thanking her, each speaking faster than the last, afraid of falling behind by even half a second.","As for the newcomer named Qing, this was the first time he had received such a huge gift. His voice was trembling.","“Th-thank you... Thank you, Food Liu You Sis, for the Confession Balloon... I, I...” He repeated “I” for a long while, too excited to get a coherent sentence out.","The little fans in the public chat went even crazier.","[Squid Strips: Aaaaaaaaaah! Our Xu finally has a big spender! Is this real?! Am I dreaming?!]","[Salted Pomelo Pear: Exactly! Two 520 gifts! That’s over a thousand yuan! Sis, are you still looking for a leg ornament?]","[Little Wimp: What kind of goddess is this? She comes in and blows up the screen right away!]","Amid the chaos and astonishment, Gu Lan leisurely typed a message into the public chat, adding an innocent-looking sticker at the end.","[Food Liu You: So, does this mean I get to cut in line now? (confused).jpg]","The moment the message appeared, the noisy chorus of thanks from the microphones came to an abrupt halt again.","Everyone caught the unmistakable sarcasm in her words.","Wasn’t she copying what Muzhi had just done—using a gift to forcibly interrupt someone else?","And doing it right in front of everyone, slapping him squarely in the face.","Muzhi’s microphone remained lit, but he did not make another sound.","Gu Lan could practically imagine how ugly his expression must be.","She was in an excellent mood.","That felt much better.","[Ding! The host has spent 520 yuan on the 90-point-attractiveness streamer “Wn.Xu,” triggering a 1:10 cashback reward. A cashback of 5,200 yuan has been credited!]","[Ding! The host has spent 520 yuan on the 81-point-attractiveness streamer “Wn.Qing,” triggering a 1:1 cashback reward. A cashback of 520 yuan has been credited!]","The system’s notification rang out in her mind, making the curve of Gu Lan’s lips grow even wider.","She had spent a thousand yuan and earned more than five thousand back.","Not bad at all.","In the public chat, some confused fans were still marveling.","[Four-Leaf Clover: Huh? Is it popular to request songs with 520-yuan gifts now? I feel bad spending even fifty-two yuan on a request.]","[One Punch Will Crush You: You didn’t get it, did you? Sis is teaching certain people how things are done!]","At that moment, the clear, soothing voice she had been longing to hear finally rang out, breaking the awkward silence with a hint of helpless amusement.","“Ahem, that’s enough. Thank you, Sis.”","Xu paused, seemingly organizing his thoughts.","“So, I’m more familiar with sad love songs, while Qing is new here, but he’s pretty good at singing pop songs.”","His voice was unhurried and steady, instantly guiding the atmosphere in the room back onto the right track.","Then he turned to the newcomer who was still stammering and said, “Qing, send your song list to... Food... Liu You Sis.”","When he said “Food Liu You,” Xu ultimately couldn’t hold back. A very soft laugh escaped through the microphone.","It was faint, but Gu Lan still heard it.","She immediately pounced on him in the public chat.","[Food Liu You: I heard that! You’re laughing at my name! (sobbing).jpg]","[Food Liu You: That’s too much! You’re being punished with one extra song!]","The fans in the public chat joined in the teasing.","[Squid Strips: Hahaha, that’s right! How could you laugh at our big sis, Brother Xu?!]","[Salted Pomelo Pear: Punish him! He absolutely has to sing!]","Xu let out a low laugh. The sound traveled through the current and slipped into Gu Lan’s ears, making her toes curl.","“My fault, my fault. I couldn’t help myself.” His voice was full of laughter. “Then... thank you, Miss Liu You?”","Gu Lan continued typing.","[Food Liu You: Listen to yourself. “Liu You”—does that sound nice to you? Can a girl really be called that?]","Xu readily went along with her. “Then... thank you, Lazy Lamb?”","Gu Lan’s avatar was an abstract-looking Lazy Lamb, so he had clearly noticed it.","That nickname...","Somehow, it sounded even cuter.","Gu Lan’s heart filled with delight. She was just about to reply when the host named Ears suddenly cut in, speaking at lightning speed.","“Hey! Sis, sis! We have a rule in our room— for 300 yuan, you can reserve a private claim! Want to reserve one?”","A private claim?","Gu Lan genuinely had no idea what that slang meant.","【Food Liu You: Private claim? What’s that?】","Ears immediately explained, “Once you reserve a private claim, no one in our room besides Xu and Qing, whom you requested, is allowed to proactively ‘assign you homework’ or send you private messages for no reason! Anyone caught doing it gets fined!”","“Assigning homework” was their slang for privately messaging someone to poach them.","The moment Ears said that, his intentions became glaringly obvious.","He was doing this to guard against Muzhi.","After all, Strawberry Cheesecake had originally come to listen to Xu as well. But because she hadn’t reserved a private claim, Muzhi had coaxed her away with a few private messages.","It was a cautionary tale.","With this move, Ears had dragged Muzhi’s little scheme straight into the open, making it impossible for him to use the same trick again.","Gu Lan understood instantly.","Oh? So that was how this worked?","Interesting.","Instead of answering directly, she deliberately tagged Xu in the public chat.","【Food Liu You: @Wn.Xu I don’t understand. Should I reserve one?】","She ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌‍tossed the ball to Xu.","The moment she asked, Xu’s fans in the public chat became more anxious than anyone else.","【Squid Strips: @Food Liu You Sis, reserve one, reserve one! Please!】","【Salted Pomelo Pear: Reserve it, reserve it, reserve it! We all did! Once you reserve one, we’ll be family!】","They were terrified that this goddess-like big sis who had appeared out of nowhere would be lured away by that greasy guy from next door.","There was silence on the mic for a few seconds.","Everyone’s attention focused on Xu.","Then he let out a soft laugh, and a hint of seriousness entered his clear, warm voice.","“Of course I hope you will.”","His answer was direct and frank.","Gu Lan was very pleased.","She liked people who didn’t beat around the bush.","【Food Liu You: Okay then, I’ll reserve one.】","She sent another message.","【Food Liu You: You guys can choose the songs yourselves. I’ll listen to whatever you’re best at.】"]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4: Off-key Practice More~","paragraphs":["The voice chat fell silent for a moment.","A few seconds later, the newcomer named Qing turned on his mic, his voice carrying a faint, nervous static.","“Th-then... I’ll go first.”","Qing sounded a little flustered, and it was obvious how embarrassed he felt.","“Otherwise, if I wait until Brother Xu finishes singing, I won’t dare open my mouth.”","His half-joking confession sent a string of “Hahahaha” and “Go for it, Qing!” across the chat.","Gu Lan found it rather amusing too.","This newcomer had a pretty good grasp of his own abilities.","Soon, the accompaniment started. It was a gentle pop love song.","Qing actually had a decent voice—a clean, youthful tone. His technique was still very raw, though, and his breathing was unsteady. He sounded like an ordinary guy who happened to sing pretty well at karaoke, with all the youthful awkwardness of an unpolished voice.","Gu Lan rested her chin in her hand as she listened, thinking to herself:","This kid is kind of adorable.","Like a fluffy, harmless little puppy, the sort that made you want to tease him.","An idea struck her. She opened the gift list.","Her finger scrolled through it before stopping on a gift called Phoenixes Soaring Together.","131,400 diamonds.","Thirteen hundred and fourteen yuan.","The number was a homophone for “a lifetime together.”","Sending it to a streamer she had known for less than an hour—one who even sang off-key—could only be described as... completely insane.","But ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌​​​​‌​​‌‌​‌‌‌​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌‍Gu Lan liked doing things like that.","Without the slightest hesitation, she tapped Send.","“...My love for you will last forever...”","On the mic, Qing had just reached the chorus when, without warning, a pair of magnificent phoenixes erupted across the screen.","Golden light and fluttering feathers instantly took over the entire display. The animation was long and spectacular, almost completely covering everyone’s usernames.","[Food Liu You sent Wn. Qing Phoenixes Soaring Together x1 (131,400 diamonds)]","Right at the moment the phoenixes reached their highest point, Qing’s singing suddenly took a spectacular detour—and flew straight to Siberia.","The melody vanished.","He stammered and tried to pull the song back on track, but his breathing was completely thrown off. In the end, all he could manage was a series of helpless hums.","The song ended in a catastrophic vocal pileup.","The entire voice room fell deathly silent.","Then the public chat exploded.","[Wn. Ears: !! My goodness! Phoenixes Soaring Together! Thank you, Big Sister Food Liu You, for sending Qing a Phoenixes Soaring Together! What an incredibly generous boss! May you always be healthy and have everything go your way!]","[Wn. Volcano: Thank you, sis! You’re amazing!]","[Wn. Yechen: Thank you, sis, for supporting Qing...]","[Squid Strips: ??? 1,314 yuan??? You just sent that without hesitation???]","[Salted Pomelo Pear: I’m speechless. That’s my entire monthly living allowance...]","[The Little Boy Who Sells Bombs: Sis! I can sing this song too! And I won’t go off-key! Look at me!]","[Room Moderator—Little Star: Don’t call her “sis,” you shameless lot! Muted!]","Amid the chaos, Gu Lan leisurely typed a message.","[Food Liu You: You went off-key! Practice more from now on.]","She added a pat-on-the-head sticker, making the message seem both generous and faintly indulgent, like a doting elder who was exasperated with a hopeless child.","Qing’s mic remained on, and his heavy breathing could be heard. He was clearly scared out of his wits.","After a long while, he finally managed to squeeze out, “Th-thank you, big sister... I-I’ll definitely practice hard...”","His voice trembled like a leaf.","Gu Lan was amused by his reaction. She was just about to tease him a little more when a thought suddenly occurred to her.","“San-chan, I’m a little curious. What do the streamers’ private group chats look like right now?”","[Ding! Easy peasy! San-chan, the God of the Internet, is now broadcasting it live for you!]","The next second, a screenshot of a WeChat group chat appeared directly in Gu Lan’s mind.","[Goodnight Melody Lineup Group]","[Wn. Volcano: Aaaaaah! Phoenixes Soaring Together! A living rich lady is here! Aaaaaah!]","[Wn. Volcano: @Wn. Qing, what kind of dog luck did you have?! I can understand Brother Xu’s situation—after all, she’s been keeping the public chat alive for so long. But what about you? You didn’t even say a word, and she threw 1,314 at your face?!]","[Wn. Yechen: ...I’m jealous.]","[Wn. Xu: That’s what you get for not doing your “homework” properly.]","[Wn. Chuan: ...I send messages to the number-one and number-two fans every day, and not one of them has ever replied to me. (Jealousy has twisted my face beyond recognition.jpg)]","[Wn. Muzhi: ...]","Muzhi had sent only six dots, but even through the screen, Gu Lan could sense the sourness and resentment practically spilling out of them.","That felt good.","Gu Lan shut down the livestream in her mind, thoroughly satisfied.","Just then, Xu cleared his throat on the public mic, and that clear, mellow voice finally rang out again.","“All right, Qing, go take a breather and have some water.”","He first soothed the shaken newcomer before speaking again at an unhurried pace.","“It’s my turn now, right? Thanks, Lazy Lamb.”","He sang the kind of heartbroken love song he was best at.","His technique was polished, and his emotions were on point. Unlike Muzhi, he didn’t have that deliberate, greasy affectation. But what truly made his performance lethal was his vocal tone.","That cool, crystalline voice with just a hint of roughness, singing lyrics about loving someone he could never have—it was nothing short of devastating.","As Gu Lan listened, she opened the gift box once again.","The joy of spending money only came once? How could that possibly be enough?","She scrolled through the gift list and soon discovered a new feature.","[Compatibility Blind Box.]","The sender could set up two boxes, each containing different-value gifts, and ask the streamer to blindly choose one.","If the streamer guessed correctly, the grand prize was yours.","If they guessed wrong, the grand prize disappeared.","It was a game that tested both rapport and luck.","Gu Lan looked at the feature description and gave a mischievous smile.","A test of luck?","Not for her. In her case, it only tested her financial resources.","She opened the blind-box setup.","In the box on the left, she selected the gift [Heart-Shaped Airplane], quantity: 30.","In the box on the right, she selected the exact same gift, also in a quantity of 30.","A single Heart-Shaped Airplane cost 18,800 diamonds, or 188 yuan. Thirty of them came to 5,640 yuan.","The two boxes together contained more than ten thousand yuan worth of gifts.","No matter which box Xu chose, the result would be exactly the same.","Once everything was set up, she tapped Send.","Xu’s song happened to be reaching its end. The final note drifted gently into silence, leaving behind a long, lingering aftertaste.","He was just about to say a few words of thanks when a huge blind box marked with a question mark slowly appeared in the center of the public chat.","[Food Liu You has issued you a Compatibility Blind Box challenge. Please choose the box on the left or the box on the right!]","Xu was visibly stunned.","“Hm? A blind box?” He let out a light laugh. “Lamb, are you testing me?”","The public chat instantly grew lively again.","[Squid Strips: Aaaaaah, it’s a Compatibility Blind Box! Brother Xu, don’t get it wrong!]","[Salted Pomelo Pear: I’m guessing! I’m guessing Big Sister Lamb put one Heart-Shaped Airplane in each box!]","[One Punch Will Crush You: Think bigger! I’m guessing ten airplanes!]","Xu looked at the chat and asked with a smile, “Which one should I choose? Lamb, give me a hint.”","Gu Lan typed leisurely.","[Food Liu You: I feel like either one is fine. (ͼ̤͂͜ͽ̤͂)✧]","The moment those words were spoken, a whole row of question marks instantly swept across the public chat.","What did she mean, “Either side is fine”?","【Squid Strips: ??? Big Sister, what do you mean by that? Could it be...】","【Salted Pomelo Pear: Could it be that both sides are the same?!】","【One Punch Will Crush You: Is this what favoritism looks like? I’m jealous!】","【Wn. Volcano: @One Punch Will Crush You I want some too! I want to be favored!】","【One Punch Will Crush You: I’ll give you a one-yuan kiss. Take it or leave it.】","Xu also caught the unusual implication in her words. After pondering for a moment, he let out a soft laugh and said, “All right. I’ll listen to you and just pick one at random.”","He casually tapped the box on the left.","The next second, the sound of a dense, continuous roar of airplane engines came through everyone’s headphones!","The screen was instantly flooded with messages.","One heart-shaped airplane effect after another shot up from the bottom of the screen with long blazing trails behind them—thirty in total, one after another without pause, resembling a spectacular meteor shower.","Because the gift was worth so much, it directly triggered a server-wide scrolling banner announcement.","【Player “Food Liu You” sent streamer “Wn. Xu” 30 Heart Planes in the room [Goodnight Melody]! Come watch!】","At that moment, every user online across the entire Oxygen app saw the gleaming golden banner.","The [Goodnight Melody] room completely lost its mind.","【Wn. Ears: ...I-I-I-I... I’m bad at math. Can someone tell me how much thirty planes cost?!】","【Little Wimp: Five thousand six hundred! It’s 5,640 yuan!!!】","【One Punch Will Crush You: No way... Does anyone play a chemistry blind box like this?! Thirty planes all at once?! I usually agonize for half an hour over whether to pick left or right before sending a three-yuan bar of soap!】","【Wn. Qing: Jealous! So jealous!】","【Squid Strips: Aaaaaah! So both sides had thirty planes?! Big Sister, just how rich are you?!】","Even Strawberry Cheesecake, who had just been overshadowed by Gu Lan, couldn’t help popping into the chat.","【Strawberry Cheesecake: I thought Brother Xu was going to get another dud, hahaha. Big Sister Lamb is so generous.】","Amid the deafening waves of astonishment and thanks, Salted Pomelo Pear sent a message that summed up everyone’s feelings.","【Salted Pomelo Pear: @Food Liu You The name “Food Liu You”—“rich enough to make oil flow”—really suits you perfectly, Big Sister Lamb.】"]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5: Military training is exhausting me to death. Did you miss me","paragraphs":["Rich Enough to Drip Money?","Yeah, that name really did suit her current situation.","She curled her lips into a smile and was just about to chat with her adorable fans in the public chat, showing off her “perfectly ordinary” ability to throw money around.","“Knock, knock-knock!”","Someone knocked on the bedroom door. A moment later, her mother’s familiar, booming voice came from outside, urging her on in a frantic rush.","“Gu Lan! What’s taking you so long? If we don’t leave now, you’ll be late for registration!”","Registration?","The smile on Gu Lan’s face froze.","What registration?","Her brain crashed for three seconds before a term she had completely banished to the far corners of her mind came crashing back—","College registration!","Oh no! She’d forgotten!","Her gaze moved away from the golden airplane effects and the flood of comments saying “Big sis is awesome!” on her phone screen. Gu Lan suddenly felt the world spinning around her.","On one side was a wealthy big sister who spent money like water and was adored by thousands.","On the other was a miserable freshman who might be late on the very first day of college and get called out by her counselor.","The gap between the two identities...","Was way too huge.","She scrambled up from the bed. Without even looking at the rapidly scrolling comments—“Big sis, look at me!” and “Rich big sister!”—she hurriedly typed a line into the chat box.","[Food Liu You: Something came up. I have to go.]","Send.","Then she snapped her laptop shut with a sharp click. Her movements were crisp and decisive, as if she hadn’t just closed an app, but an entire virtual world of luxury and excess.","“I’m coming, I’m coming!” she called as she dragged her suitcase out from under the bed and dashed out of the bedroom.","...","One week later.","A University, Girls’ Dormitory Room 303.","Gu Lan lay sprawled on her upper bunk like a dried-out salted fish, all four limbs splayed out. She didn’t even have the strength to move a finger.","The week-long hellish military training had finally ended.","She felt as though every last bit of her had been hollowed out, leaving behind only a sweat-soaked, sun-blackened shell.","Her roommates were in much the same condition.","“I hereby announce that my legs no longer belong to me,” Zhu Jiaying declared. She was a hot-tempered girl from Sichuan, and at that moment she was moaning as she rubbed soothing cream onto her calves.","“Jiaying, keep it down. I feel like my ears are buzzing,” Liu Anyao said weakly from the opposite bed, pushing up her glasses.","In ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌​​​​‌​​‌‌​‌‌‌​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌‍the corner, Wu Luyi had gone a step further and put on a steam eye mask. She murmured, “Let me die. Let me die in the paradise of the second dimension...”","Gu Lan kept her eyes closed. There was only one thought in her mind.","So tired.","She was tired right down to her bones.","But amid that fog of exhaustion, a clear yet slightly lazy voice suddenly surfaced without warning.","“...Thank you, Lazy Lamb.”","“Then... thank you, Miss Foodflow?”","The man gave a low chuckle, his voice indulgent and doting.","Gu Lan jolted and opened her eyes.","That’s right! Xu!","She hadn’t logged into the Oxygen app for almost a week!","A strange sense of urgency surged through her. Forgetting all about her aching body, she struggled to grab the phone beside her pillow.","She unlocked it, found the orange-and-white app icon, and tapped it.","In an instant, countless notification messages flooded the top of the screen.","Gu Lan had no interest in checking the room announcements and system messages cluttering up the screen. She went straight to her private messages.","Two chat windows sat quietly at the very top, each marked with a red unread notification.","[Wn.Xu]","[Wn.Qing]","Without the slightest hesitation, she tapped Xu’s avatar.","The chat history still stopped at the day she had logged off.","After she sent, “Something came up. I have to go,” Xu had replied almost instantly.","[Wn.Xu: Mm. Go take care of things.]","[Wn.Xu: Be careful on the way.]","A few minutes later, another message had appeared.","[Wn.Xu: Are you still busy?]","Gu Lan stared at the message, and her heart inexplicably skipped a beat.","Further down were messages from the second day, the third day...","Every day, he had sent her a simple greeting.","[Wn.Xu: Busy today?]","[Wn.Xu: Still not done? Have you forgotten about me?]","[Wn.Xu: (Pouty).jpg]","The last message had been sent three days ago. Looking at that reaction image, Gu Lan couldn’t help laughing.","She could practically imagine the man sitting in front of his microphone, opening their chat again and again, only to be disappointed each time.","Kind of cute.","At the same time, messages were rapidly scrolling through a WeChat group chat made up entirely of streamers.","[Goodnight Melody Lineup Group]","[Wn.Yechen: @Wn.Brother Xu, that new big sister of yours... Could her rich-lady experience card really have expired? She hasn’t logged on for a whole week.]","[Wn.Muzhi: Maybe she’s just a student who saved up some pocket money and came on to experience the lifestyle. That’s normal.]","[Wn.Muzhi: It’s just that... the room battle is tomorrow, and Brother Xu, your target is still the one set back when Cheesecake Sis was around, right? A revenue target of 180,000 is pretty high. Why don’t you talk to Boss Garlic Paste and ask him to lower it?]","His words sounded like concern, but every single one of them stabbed at Xu’s heart.","[Wn.Ears: There’s no need for you to pretend to care! We’ll figure out Brother Xu’s target ourselves!]","A new message suddenly appeared. It was from one of the room’s financial backers.","[Boss-Garlic Paste: @Wn.Xu Where are you? Has that Food Liu You replied to your private messages?]","The group fell silent for several seconds.","[Wn.Xu: No.]","[Boss-Garlic Paste: No? The room battle is tomorrow, and your target is the highest in the entire room. Don’t you know that? If you can’t complete it, you can forget about being the room manager. According to the rules, you’ll have to cover the penalty yourself. I told you to put more effort into maintaining your clients. Are you finally panicking now?]","Garlic Paste’s words were blunt, carrying the force and pressure of someone in charge.","[Wn.Ears: Boss, Big Sister Lamb might really have something going on. Squid Strips and Salt Juice also said they’ve been busy with military training since starting college. None of them have had time to log on for a week.]","[Boss-Garlic Paste: I don’t care what she has going on. The rules are the rules. @Wn.Xu You figure it out yourself.]","The group fell silent once again.","No one dared to say anything else.","And Gu Lan, far away in her college dormitory, knew nothing about any of it.","She was happily tapping away at her phone, her fingers flying across the keyboard.","[Food Liu You: I’m back!!!]","[Food Liu You: I’ve been doing military training lately! It practically killed me!]","The moment she sent the messages, the words “The other person is typing...” appeared at the top of the chat window.","Gu Lan’s heart rose and fell along with those few words.","He replied so fast!","[Wn.Xu: Military training? You’re a freshman?]","Looking at the reply, Gu Lan’s smile spread wider and wider.","She deliberately didn’t answer right away, mischievously leaving him hanging for a few seconds before slowly typing.","[Food Liu You: Yes~ Yes~]","[Food Liu You: It’s been a whole week since we saw each other. Did you miss me? (Kitten peeking out).jpg]","[Food Liu You: You were the first person I looked for as soon as I got my phone back~]","After sending the messages, she tossed her phone onto the pillow, covered her face with both hands, and rolled around on the bed twice.","Her phone buzzed. She immediately snatched it back up.","On the screen, “Typing...” appeared, then disappeared; disappeared, then appeared again.","Back and forth several times.","What was he hesitating over?","Gu Lan’s curiosity was thoroughly piqued.","Finally, a new message popped up.","Just one word and an emoji.","【Wn.Xu: Want. (blushing).jpg】","!!!","Gu Lan felt as if a kitten’s paw had lightly scratched at her heart, leaving it tingling and itchy.","【Food Liu You: Why aren’t you in the room? I want to hear your voice.】"]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6: You Call Me 'Sister'~","paragraphs":["On the other end of the phone, the reply came almost instantly.","【Wn.Xu: Today’s hall battle. I’ve already been put on the schedule.】","Gu Lan blinked.","Hall battle?","She had heard the term before. It was an activity held between guilds on certain voice-chat apps to compete for resources and rankings.","Sometimes, two guilds would go head-to-head, with the winner being whoever received more gifts.","Other times, a guild would assign its streamers targets, with penalties for anyone who failed to meet them.","【Food Liu You: A hall battle? Are you guys competing against another hall?】","【Wn.Xu: No PK. Our hall just sets a target.】","Gu Lan understood.","So it was the second kind.","Her fingers moved, and she sent over another question.","【Food Liu You: So, did you complete your target?】","But after she sent the message, the other side went silent.","The “typing...” indicator lit up, then disappeared, only to light up again.","Gu Lan could practically imagine the helpless look on the man’s face as the question left him speechless.","After quite a while, a single line finally drifted over.","【Wn.Xu: ?】","【Wn.Xu: Why would you ask such a hurtful question?】","Gu Lan burst out laughing. Hugging her pillow, she rolled across the bed.","So cute. Way too cute.","She cleared her throat, fighting back her laughter as her fingers flew across the keyboard, her teasing taking on a distinctly mischievous edge.","【Food Liu You: Call me Big Sis.】","【Food Liu You: I’ll help you complete your target.】","This time, the “typing...” indicator on the other end vanished completely, replaced by a long silence.","Gu Lan wasn’t in a hurry. She simply propped up her chin and waited.","She knew he would reply.","Sure enough, a minute later, a new message popped up.","【Wn.Xu: You’re younger than me...】","Gu Lan’s wicked streak immediately surfaced.","【Food Liu You: Doesn’t matter. I want to hear it.】","【Food Liu You: Call me Big Sis!】","Bossy and completely unreasonable.","Even ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​‌​​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​‍Gu Lan found herself amused.","This time, the silence lasted even longer.","Just as Gu Lan began to wonder whether she had scared him off, a green voice-message bar suddenly appeared in the chat window.","1 second.","Only one second.","Gu Lan’s heartbeat skipped.","She instinctively sat up straight. She even smoothed down her messy hair from military training before carefully bringing the phone to her ear and pressing play.","A soft male voice slipped against her ear. It carried a hint of helplessness, mixed with an indescribable indulgence and fondness.","“Big Sis~”","The final note lifted slightly and lingered, like a feather lightly, yet unmistakably, teasing the very tip of her heart.","It was both deeply attractive and utterly intoxicating.","Boom!","Gu Lan felt the tips of her ears, along with half her cheeks, suddenly catch fire.","Oh, no.","Who could possibly withstand this?","Before she could recover from the devastating impact of that single “Big Sis,” her phone vibrated again. A new text message appeared right after the voice note.","【Wn.Xu: It’s fine. I’ve already paid the penalty.】","【Wn.Xu: Save it for next time.】","He had already paid the penalty?","Gu Lan froze for a moment, then understood.","He had failed to meet the target and paid the penalty out of his own pocket.","No.","How could she let him miss out on making money?","【Food Liu You: No, no. I’m helping you complete it today.】","【Food Liu You: Come on! Let’s go to the hall! (angry).jpg】","【Wn.Xu: ...】","【Wn.Xu: All right. I’ll go request a mic slot.】","...","Xu moved quickly.","Gu Lan had only just entered the voice hall 【Goodnight Melody】 when she saw that Xu’s profile picture had already appeared at the end of the mic queue.","At that moment, the people on mic were chatting animatedly.","It was that fence-sitter, Yechen.","“...Why is Brother Xu coming up? Didn’t he say he wasn’t going to participate today? You already paid the penalty for missing the target?”","The instant he finished speaking, another loud, boisterous voice rang out. It belonged to the mood-maker, Ears.","“Big Sister Lamb! Big Sister Lamb is here! Holy crap! Welcome home, Sister FoodLiuYou!”","With that shout from Ears, the public chat instantly exploded.","【Salted Pomelo Pear: Aaaaaaaaaah, Big Sister Lamb! You’re finally back?!】","【Squid Strips: Sis! I missed you so much!】","【Little Wimp: Welcome home, Big Sister!】","Looking at the screen filled with welcomes, Gu Lan’s mood brightened. She was just about to type a reply when her attention was caught by a gleaming number in the mic queue.","Beneath Muzhi’s profile picture was a line of gift points that kept ticking upward.","【Box Score: 3,345,600】","Three million points.","At Oxygen’s exchange rate, that amounted to over thirty thousand yuan.","He had received more than thirty thousand in a single day?","Gu Lan raised her brows, a little surprised.","On mic, Yechen continued fawning over him. The envy and jealousy in his voice practically spilled through the screen.","“Brother Muzhi is incredible! He received an Eternal Black Gold for today’s hall battle! Oh my god, an Eternal Black Gold! I’ve dreamed of receiving one. Looks like I’ll never have a chance in this lifetime...”","Eternal Black Gold?","Gu Lan thought she had seen that name in the gift list before, but she hadn’t paid much attention to it.","She casually typed a line in the public chat.","【Food Liu You: Eternal Black Gold?】","The moment she appeared, someone immediately responded.","【Salted Pomelo Pear: Big Sister, Eternal Black Gold is the most expensive gift on the platform. The special effects are incredible! One costs 2,888,888 diamonds!】","Two million eight hundred eighty-eight thousand diamonds.","Converted, that was 28,888.88 yuan.","One gift cost nearly thirty thousand yuan.","【Strawberry Cheesecake: It’s expensive, sure, but it’s also genuinely ugly. It’s so gaudy and golden—it screams nouveau riche. If Muzhi hadn’t insisted on using it to climb the rankings, I really would’ve sent something with better effects.】","Reading their messages, Gu Lan understood.","It was the most expensive gift, but it was ugly.","Muzhi had wanted his top supporter to send it specifically so he could climb the rankings.","A brilliant idea suddenly popped into her head.","【Food Liu You: I’ve never seen it before. You’ve all made it sound so impressive.】","【Food Liu You: I’ll send one and take a look.】","The public chat fell silent for a moment.","Then, several hesitant comments floated up.","【Salted Pomelo Pear: ...Big Sister, that one’s really expensive...】","【Squid Strips: Yeah, Big Sister, you don’t have to spend so much. Just listen to the songs!】","They all thought Gu Lan was joking, or that she didn’t know how much it cost.","Even Yechen, up on mic, let out two awkward laughs.","“Haha, Big Sister Lamb is such a joker. That gift really is... well, not something ordinary people can afford.”","Gu Lan ignored them.","Her finger had already tapped on Xu’s profile picture.","A gift-sending window popped up on the screen.","She swiped through the dazzling array of gifts and quickly found the name she was looking for—【Eternal Black Gold】.","Just as Strawberry Cheesecake had said, the icon was indeed golden and gaudy, radiating the unmistakable air of a nouveau riche tycoon. The design had absolutely no sense of beauty.","But beneath the icon was a small set of quick-send options.","【x1】, 【x10】, 【x38】.","Gu Lan’s fingertip lightly tapped the screen, landing precisely on the 【x10】 option.","A payment confirmation dialog immediately appeared in the center of the screen.","【You are about to send 10 Eternal Black Gold gifts to streamer “Wn.Xu,” for a total of 28,888,880 diamonds. Confirm?】","More than twenty-eight million diamonds.","Nearly 300,000 yuan.","Gu Lan didn’t even blink.","Confirm. Send.","Her finger pressed down lightly."]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7: Ten black golds, is that enough","paragraphs":["In that instant, the entire voice room seemed to have been muted.","Time froze for 0.01 seconds.","Then—","BOOM——!!!","The screen exploded.","This wasn’t the gorgeous, dreamy special effect of Phoenix in Flight from earlier. This was a nearly brutal, utterly unreasonable visual assault.","Ten enormous, glittering, golden [Eternal Black Gold] gift effects came charging up from the bottom of the screen one after another, each more aggressively than the last.","The rich, tacky gold light was practically blinding everyone.","The animation was long and overbearing, smearing the entire public chat into a golden mosaic. Even the avatars of everyone on the mics were completely covered.","Before anyone could recover from the sea of gold, an even more dazzling and brazen banner swept across the top of the entire Oxygen app, visible to every user.","[Supreme Announcement: Player “Food Liu You” has sent streamer “Wn.Xu” 10 Eternal Black Gold gifts in the room [Goodnight Melody]! A miracle has descended—come witness it!]","The golden words, accompanied by a scrolling effect, passed by once, twice, three times...","Every user online throughout the app—whether they were in a music room, a social room, or even a game room—saw this epic full-server announcement at that very moment.","This tiny voice room, [Goodnight Melody], was instantly flooded with countless passersby who had come running after hearing the news.","The room’s online numbers shot from a few hundred to several thousand in an instant, and continued rising at a terrifying speed.","The public chat completely went insane.","[Holy crap!? Am I seeing things? Ten Black Golds?!]","[Which tycoon is that? Food Liu You? Never heard of them. A newcomer?]","[No way... Are room battles this insane now? Spending three hundred thousand on an internal task for a small guild? Is that even reasonable?]","[I just checked her profile. This Food Liu You account was created recently! A total newbie!]","[She just registered and immediately threw down three hundred thousand? Are rich women this wild nowadays? I wonder how she compares to Sister Yaya.]","[Heh, she just got carried away. You really think anyone can compare with our Sister Yaya? Sister Yaya has spent over ten million on Oxygen. Someone who’s just here to experience life will get bored after a few days.]","[Don’t start a fight! They’re all generous big sisters! As long as Big Sister is happy! Big Sister is awesome!]","Meanwhile, inside [Goodnight Melody], the eight streamers on the mics, along with every moderator and fan in the room, had all turned to stone.","Complete silence.","You could hear a pin drop.","Even Ears, the atmosphere-maker who had been frantically stirring up the crowd moments ago, had fallen silent. His microphone was pitch-black, without a sound.","Their brains had been completely smashed into shutdown mode by those ten Black Gold gifts.","One cost nearly thirty thousand.","Ten cost nearly three hundred thousand.","Three hundred thousand yuan, all for a streamer’s unfinished task—one with a penalty of only a few thousand yuan?","What kind of concept was that?","This wasn’t merely being rich anymore. This was pathological!","Xu sat in front of his computer, watching the golden afterglow on the screen slowly fade. In his headphones came the roar of the gift effects and the crazed barrage of messages from the newcomers.","He had thought Gu Lan would send one.","After all, she had asked him, and he knew she wasn’t short of money.","Sending one would save his pride while also showing off her financial power.","But he had never imagined that she would send ten.","And in such an absurd manner.","Three hundred thousand yuan.","For an online streamer she had known for less than a week and had never even met in person.","Just who was this girl?","While the entire voice room was trapped in a strange silence, an incomparably pleasant notification rang out in Gu Lan’s mind.","[Ding! The host has spent 288,888.8 yuan on a target with a facial attractiveness score of 90, triggering a tenfold cashback! A cashback amount of 2,888,888 yuan has been credited. Please check your account!]","That felt good.","Gu Lan stretched contentedly. Looking at the long string of numbers in the bank notification on her phone, the smile on her face deepened.","Making money really was wonderful.","At last, Ears’s loud and boisterous voice was the first to return, trembling with excitement and breaking several times.","“I-I-I-I... I hereby announce! From today onward, Big Sister Lamb is my one and only big sister! Sorry, Brother Xu! You’re going to have to take a back seat!”","Right afterward, the newcomer Qing also typed a message in the public chat, followed by more than a dozen kneeling emojis.","[Wn.Qing: I’d never seen a Black Gold before. I thought I’d go my whole life without seeing one. But today... I’ve seen so many I’m getting sick of them.]","Volcano also opened his mic and shouted in a half-joking, half-serious tone, “Where are my fans!? See that!? That’s someone else’s big sister! I want Black Gold too! Did you hear me? Send me Black Gold!”","His fans immediately responded in the public chat.","[Little Wimp: ??? Are you still dreaming?]","[One Punch Will Crush You: Volcano, close your eyes right now. Hurry. I’ll send you a hundred in your dreams.]","Amid the chaos, Gu Lan’s gaze swept over the mic order and landed on the avatar at the very bottom—right beneath the newcomer Qing.","The gift-value box below his avatar contained a pitifully low score. Converted into yuan, it probably wasn’t even worth a hundred.","The poor kid was rather pitiful.","With a thought, she opened the gift list again.","Before anyone else could react, another [Eternal Black Gold] effect burst into the air.","This time, however, the recipient was the newcomer at the end of the mic order—","Wn.Qing.","If the ten Black Golds earlier had been an atomic bomb that left everyone stunned, then this one was a sugar-coated artillery shell casually tossed out for fun, blasting the recipient, Qing, completely senseless.","He ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​‌​​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​‍even forgot to speak when he got on the mic and could only type frantically in the public chat.","[Wn.Qing: !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Big Sister!!!! Thank you, Big Sister! I’m bowing to you—bang bang bang! I can’t speak anymore! Aaaaaah!]","This time, even the fans of the other streamers couldn’t stay calm.","Even Muzhi’s big sister, Strawberry Cheesecake, couldn’t help popping up.","[Strawberry Cheesecake: ...Does Big Sister Lamb need another little sister? I can do the “nyaa nyaa” thing.]","Gu Lan was laughing so hard at the barrage of flattery that she was about to chat with them a little longer when a private-message notification suddenly appeared at the top of her phone screen.","It was Xu.","She opened it.","[Wn.Xu: Want to hear a song?]","Looking at those four simple words, Gu Lan began wondering what expression the person on the other side of the screen was wearing.","She had just started typing to request a song when Wu Luyi, who had been lying motionless in the dorm room with a steam eye mask on, suddenly sat bolt upright as if revived from the brink of death.","“Girls! Major news!”","Her shout brought the other two girls, who had also been lying motionless, back to life.","Rubbing her calf, Zhu Jiaying asked irritably, “What is it? Did one of your paper-thin fictional characters come back to life?”","“Even more explosive than that!” Wu Luyi held up her phone, her face glowing with excitement. “You know Chen Sisi from the dorm across from ours, right? The rich heiress covered head to toe in designer brands! We went to high school together. She said she wants to treat our whole dorm to the hottest male-model club in town for a little eye-opening experience! She’s asking if we want to go and make up the numbers!”","“A male-model club?!” Zhu Jiaying’s eyes lit up instantly. Her calf stopped hurting, and the ringing in her ears disappeared too. “Seriously?!”","“Of course it’s serious! Chen Sisi just asked me in the hallway!”","“I’m in! We absolutely have to go!” Zhu Jiaying slapped the bed frame. “I’ve lived this long and never seen a real male model!”","Liu Anyáo pushed up her glasses and asked quietly, “...Will it be expensive?”","“Chen Sisi is paying! What’s there to worry about?” Wu Luyi was practically buzzing with excitement. “So? Are you going or not?”","“Yes!”","“Of course!”","Three pairs of eyes turned in unison toward Gu Lan, who was still lying on the top bunk.","Gu Lan: “...”","Male models?","Her mind instantly filled with images of handsome men with chiseled abs.","She had to go! Absolutely had to!","She immediately grabbed her phone. Forget singing—she quickly typed into the chat box.","【Food Liu You: No more singing, no more singing! My roommates are calling me out to go shopping! I’ll find you tomorrow!】","The other person replied almost instantly.","【Wn.Xu: This late?】","【Wn.Xu: Be careful.】","【Wn.Xu: See you tomorrow.】","Gu Lan looked at his concerned reminders, her heart turning sweet, but she couldn’t help feeling that something was missing.","Her eyes shifted, and she gave a mischievous smile.","【Food Liu You: Did you forget something?】","The other side was silent for a few seconds.","【Wn.Xu: Huh?】","【Wn.Xu: Good night?】","Seeing how adorably confused he was, the curve of Gu Lan’s lips grew wider and wider.","【Food Liu You: Why didn’t you call me Big Sis?】","This time, the “typing...” indicator lingered for a long while.","Just when Gu Lan began to wonder whether he was too shy to say it, a new message finally popped up.","【Wn.Xu: Big Sis......】","Two words, followed by a blushing sticker.","Gu Lan’s heart fluttered as if a feather had gently brushed across it—tingly and itchy all at once.","She happily typed out another message.","【Food Liu You: Good boy. I’ll come find you tomorrow.】"]}]);
